										<p class="pgdmtext">
											GIMS, G. Noida endeavors to emphasize upon the skill building of its students by multidisciplinary research, consulting and partnerships with the corporate. GIMS relentlessly strives to foster the corporate and the academia relationship through industry exposure, industry and academia amalgamation, MOU’s with various professional bodies and skill enhancement of its millennial managers. To fulfill the intent various Centers of Excellence have been formed in the institution in every area of management. Corporate Resource Centre (CRC), is one of those centers of excellence - an interface between the industry and the institute.
											<br>
											<br>
											CRC embraces a dedicated team of Dean CRC, Head CRC and executives. The team is engaged in harnessing the opportunities available in the industry for the placements and Summer Internships of the students. Team CRC runs in tandem with the CRC Committee and is led by a group of student representatives who hold the positions of Secretary/Coordinator/Members respectively in the committee. These are the academic face of the institution to the corporate world. The prime motive of the CRC is to build and maintain a long term and mutually rewarding relationships with corporates in the country and abroad, elevating the industry-academia interface. GIMS, Greater Noida is a student driven organization, thus CRC also works closely with the student representatives of the CRC- the CRC committee. Team CRC is committed to hunt for the right fit organization for the students by identifying, targeting and selecting the companies for campus placements and summer internship programmes. The process is tedious and works round the year.
											<br>
											<br>
											The CRC attempts to provide the corporate and the GIMSians a platform to come together.
										</p>
